---
output: preproc, svg
---
@startuml
' EXPECT (preproc): read_crlf.txt holds "one" CR LF "two" CR "three" LF; as Python reads a text
' file, puml.read gives LF everywhere
' title False [one, two, three, ] 4
!text = puml.read("read_crlf.txt")
title !{"\r" in text} [!{", ".join(text.split("\n"))}] !{len(text.split("\n"))}
@enduml
